Package: replikit
Type: Package
Title: Rule-Constrained SMA Replication Engine
Version: 0.2.0
Author: Taylor Wood
Maintainer: Taylor Wood <twood@callodine.com>
Description: Replicates base portfolio trades and targets into separately
